(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: the supernatant is removed before
   the plate goes on the magnet, which aspirates the beads. Under
   'regex-timed-interval-symbolic', and with the budget `[5, 10]` in place of
   `![5, 10]`, it is accepted, the removal fitting beside the wait of six
   minutes:

     Typing error: Variable `binding` is unboxed with grade `[{AddBeads; !6;
       RemoveLiquid; MagnetOn}, {AddBeads; !6; RemoveLiquid; MagnetOn}]`
       accumulated since it was bound, which is not below its box grade
       `[{AddBeads; ![5, 10]; MagnetOn}, {AddBeads; ![5, 10]; MagnetOn}]`
       Note: the resource inequality `[{AddBeads; !6; RemoveLiquid; MagnetOn},
       {AddBeads; !6; RemoveLiquid; MagnetOn}] <= [{AddBeads; ![5, 10];
       MagnetOn}, {AddBeads; ![5, 10]; MagnetOn}]` does not hold
*)
(*
