       Note: the resource inequality `[{Wash; ChangeTip; (Wash; ChangeTip)*;
       Wash; RemoveLiquid; !1; ChangeTip}, {Wash; ChangeTip;
       (Wash; ChangeTip)*; Wash; RemoveLiquid; !1; ChangeTip}] <= [{Wash;
       ChangeTip; Wash; !2; ChangeTip}, {(Wash; ChangeTip)*; Wash; ![2, 3];
       ChangeTip}]` does not hold
*)
(*
